.github/workflows/ci.yml:40 note several-labels list: runs-on lists 3 labels (self-hosted, linux, x64); a runner must carry all of them and a Profile's scale set answers to its own name, so replace the list with one Profile name by hand
.github/workflows/ci.yml:44 note hosted-in-a-list list: runs-on lists 2 labels (ubuntu-latest, gpu); a runner must carry all of them and a Profile's scale set answers to its own name, so replace the list with one Profile name by hand; suggested: ubuntu-latest -> erainfra-4vcpu-ubuntu-2604
.github/workflows/ci.yml:49 note group-and-labels group: the job also asks for runner group "ubuntu-runners"; the Profile's scale set must be in that group (the controller's ERAINFRA_RUNNER_GROUP), or drop group:
.github/workflows/ci.yml:54 note group-and-label-list group: the job also asks for runner group "larger"; the Profile's scale set must be in that group (the controller's ERAINFRA_RUNNER_GROUP), or drop group:
.github/workflows/ci.yml:59 note group-only group: runs-on names only the runner group "ubuntu-runners"; a Profile is chosen by label, so add labels: <profile> by hand
.github/workflows/ci.yml:67 note aliased alias: runs-on is the YAML alias *default-runner; it changes only with its anchor on line 63
